{"2026.3.9:P01-Q03":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>实验室安全与氨喷泉操作</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.3.9 · 二轮信息必刷卷02（全国通用） · 原题3 · P01-Q03</div><h1>实验室安全与氨喷泉操作</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学实验基础/仪器使用与实验安全</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：依据药品保存、应急处理和装置操作判断安全。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">化学实验基础/常见物质的制备/常见气体的制备与收集</span><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/氮族元素及其化合物/氮的氧化物</span><span class=\"tag\">化学与STSE/化学与环境保护</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H 1  C 12  N 14  O 16   S 32  Cl 35.5  Fe 56</p><p>3．关于实验室安全，下列说法不正确的是(    )</p><p>A．实验室可将少量铯保存在煤油中</p><p>B．轻微烫伤，可先用洁净的冷水处理，再涂上烫伤药膏</p><p>C．对于酸、碱废液，确定混合无危险时，可每次各取少量分次混合后再排放</p><p>D．氨溶于水的喷泉实验，先挤压胶头滴管，使水进入烧瓶，再打开弹簧夹</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】D</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】A项，铯是密度最大的碱金属，铯会沉入煤油底部以防止其与氧气反应，故可用煤油保存，A正确；B项，冷水降温可减少热损伤，药膏防止感染，符合实验室烫伤应急处理规范，B正确；C项，酸、碱废液混合无危险时，可以通过少量多次混合后再排放，C正确；D项，应该先打开弹簧夹，再挤压胶头滴管，否则①不够严谨，无法得出氨易溶于 水的结论判断，②先挤压胶头滴管，瓶内气压迅速下降，会引起胶头和胶管较大变形，此时打开弹簧夹， 液体迅猛倒吸，冲击烧瓶内壁，可能导致烧瓶破裂，或带氨的液体溅出灼伤皮肤、黏膜，有一定的安全问题，D错误；故选D。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.3.9\\2026年高考化学二轮信息必刷卷（14+4题型）（全国通用）\\2026年高考化学二轮信息必刷卷（14+4题型）（全国通用）\\2026年高考化学二轮信息必刷卷02（全国通用卷）（全解全析）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.3.9/2026%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%BA%8C%E8%BD%AE%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%BF%85%E5%88%B7%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%8814%2B4%E9%A2%98%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%88%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BD%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89/2026%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%BA%8C%E8%BD%AE%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%BF%85%E5%88%B7%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%8814%2B4%E9%A2%98%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%88%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BD%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89/2026%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%BA%8C%E8%BD%AE%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%BF%85%E5%88%B7%E5%8D%B702%EF%BC%88%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BD%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%88%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E5%85%A8%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":[],"refs":{},"sourceSha256":"56f4379f0bb04e6484125160af89ff442c7bd7f97c391c3978cf0085c119af24","bom":false,"legacyPath":"化学实验基础/仪器使用与实验安全/2026.3.9/P01-Q03_实验室安全与氨喷泉操作.html"},"2026.3.9:P02-Q08":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>氢键键角与酸性解释</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.3.9 · 一模保分卷（湖南专用） · 原题8 · P02-Q08</div><h1>氢键键角与酸性解释</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/分子的构型及相关理论</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：比较孤电子对、分子间作用力与诱导效应。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构 化学键/分子间作用力</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构与性质/电离能 电负性</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/弱电解质的电离/电离平衡常数和电离度</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构 化学键/化学键/共价键</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H 1  C 12  O 16  Na 23  S 32  Cl 35.5  Ti 48  Co 59  Cu 64  Eu 152</p><p>8．下列关于物质的结构或性质的描述及解释都正确的是</p><p>A．沸点：对羟基苯甲醛&gt;邻羟基苯甲醛，是由于对羟基苯甲醛分子间范德华力更强</p><p>B．键角：<img src=\"chem-asset:cba463bc92ef6eccace0f4eb6a0e3e2539d709b1ee8ec219ce85fc97f2599f6d:0;\" style=\"width:76.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，是由于<img src=\"chem-asset:3f4e53f842548bfb65016b7896188e025d032efaeef2887487b48983f7047e60:1;\" style=\"width:35.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中O上孤电子对数比H<sub>2</sub>O分中O上的少</p><p>C．稳定性：<img src=\"chem-asset:f4558fac6f7a0a9a308a6e169d9e41e0612bebc4bb7c6136adc59e412e96d0d7:2;\" style=\"width:66.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，是由于水分子间存在氢键</p><p>D．酸性：<img src=\"chem-asset:6c5c719e0016eca205af5f54749a32058b9a50ee4b7f2e73757758bc3a2c0940:3;\" style=\"width:154.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，是由于<img src=\"chem-asset:2df1e4f7dfd5552e4ef0e8e474b38a61c7f7c0a0ed7142b3424c2d7c30ee1b59:4;\" style=\"width:82.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的羧基中羟基极性更小</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】B</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】A．沸点：对羟基苯甲醛&gt;邻羟基苯甲醛，是因为对羟基苯甲醛形成分子间氢键，邻羟基苯甲醛形成分子内氢键，所以对羟基苯甲醛分子间作用力较大，熔沸点也较高，A错误；</p><p>Ｂ．中心原子价层电子对数相同时，随着孤电子对数增多，成键电子对与成键电子对之间的斥力减小，键角也减小， H<sub>2</sub>O的孤电子对数=<img src=\"chem-asset:5b5f2de209deb4ca77812adc24b48c031a928162bac1569aea04be9a5c1a2ea1:5;\" style=\"width:65.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，H<sub>3</sub>O<sup>+</sup>的孤电子对数=<img src=\"chem-asset:42772c5a23d608b37faf131e95c2e9d8fd243414f0723b07fe1ec03179874104:6;\" style=\"width:71.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，所以键角大小为<img src=\"chem-asset:cba463bc92ef6eccace0f4eb6a0e3e2539d709b1ee8ec219ce85fc97f2599f6d:0;\" style=\"width:76.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B正确；</p><p>C．稳定性：<img src=\"chem-asset:f4558fac6f7a0a9a308a6e169d9e41e0612bebc4bb7c6136adc59e412e96d0d7:2;\" style=\"width:66.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，是因为H-O键键能比H-S键大，C错误；</p><p>D．Cl的电负性大于H，电负性越大，形成共价键的极性越强，因此，<img src=\"chem-asset:6f4e590461eb2ead5264d0fd9b5bb9dd1794020fc2524f67ba715ce3c36822c7:7;\" style=\"width:38.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的极性大于<img src=\"chem-asset:4268dd701048f568ab0682b0751782c18328f95c92949451ace862fbbb0723c5:8;\" style=\"width:36.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的极性，导致<img src=\"chem-asset:2df1e4f7dfd5552e4ef0e8e474b38a61c7f7c0a0ed7142b3424c2d7c30ee1b59:4;\" style=\"width:82.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的羧基中的羟基极性更大，更容易电离出氢离子，酸性<img src=\"chem-asset:6c5c719e0016eca205af5f54749a32058b9a50ee4b7f2e73757758bc3a2c0940:3;\" style=\"width:154.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，D错误；</p><p>答案选B。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.3.9\\化学一模保分卷（湖南专用）学易金卷：2026年高考第一次模拟考试\\化学一模保分卷（湖南专用）（全解全析）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.3.9/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%A8%A1%E4%BF%9D%E5%88%86%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%E5%AD%A6%E6%98%93%E9%87%91%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%9A2026%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%A8%A1%E4%BF%9D%E5%88%86%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%88%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E5%85%A8%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["2df1e4f7dfd5552e4ef0e8e474b38a61c7f7c0a0ed7142b3424c2d7c30ee1b59","3f4e53f842548bfb65016b7896188e025d032efaeef2887487b48983f7047e60","4268dd701048f568ab0682b0751782c18328f95c92949451ace862fbbb0723c5","42772c5a23d608b37faf131e95c2e9d8fd243414f0723b07fe1ec03179874104","5b5f2de209deb4ca77812adc24b48c031a928162bac1569aea04be9a5c1a2ea1","6c5c719e0016eca205af5f54749a32058b9a50ee4b7f2e73757758bc3a2c0940","6f4e590461eb2ead5264d0fd9b5bb9dd1794020fc2524f67ba715ce3c36822c7","cba463bc92ef6eccace0f4eb6a0e3e2539d709b1ee8ec219ce85fc97f2599f6d","f4558fac6f7a0a9a308a6e169d9e41e0612bebc4bb7c6136adc59e412e96d0d7"],"refs":{"chem-asset:cba463bc92ef6eccace0f4eb6a0e3e2539d709b1ee8ec219ce85fc97f2599f6d:0;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/1219252bc88e49bc45ef4cfe.png","chem-asset:3f4e53f842548bfb65016b7896188e025d032efaeef2887487b48983f7047e60:1;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/15b80fdbda9be3868f51b56b.png","chem-asset:f4558fac6f7a0a9a308a6e169d9e41e0612bebc4bb7c6136adc59e412e96d0d7:2;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/5c9968d0ba40ee042a189477.png","chem-asset:6c5c719e0016eca205af5f54749a32058b9a50ee4b7f2e73757758bc3a2c0940:3;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/5829b888fbe0b64944688e6b.png","chem-asset:2df1e4f7dfd5552e4ef0e8e474b38a61c7f7c0a0ed7142b3424c2d7c30ee1b59:4;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/51ecf0e954e1a99ff467dd63.png","chem-asset:5b5f2de209deb4ca77812adc24b48c031a928162bac1569aea04be9a5c1a2ea1:5;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/b2ec72f72396cef19af0f10a.png","chem-asset:42772c5a23d608b37faf131e95c2e9d8fd243414f0723b07fe1ec03179874104:6;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/c2c4c501337942d819f12057.png","chem-asset:6f4e590461eb2ead5264d0fd9b5bb9dd1794020fc2524f67ba715ce3c36822c7:7;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/e1eb48f448aa775c25c39525.png","chem-asset:4268dd701048f568ab0682b0751782c18328f95c92949451ace862fbbb0723c5:8;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/f46b4819f3b468ab9bceb681.png"},"sourceSha256":"1d3c256f0d2761ce5e21d8ac815e2306d0409087a5c6a2c880e5cf1000ae3e33","bom":false,"legacyPath":"物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/分子的构型及相关理论/2026.3.9/P02-Q08_氢键键角与酸性解释.html"},"2026.3.9:P03-Q05":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>黑磷与石墨的层状结构</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.3.9 · 一模提分卷（湖南专用） · 原题5 · P03-Q05</div><h1>黑磷与石墨的层状结构</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/常见几种晶体类型</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：比较导电机制、成键数和杂化。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构 化学键/化学键/共价键</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构 化学键/分子间作用力</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/晶体常识</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H 1  C 12  O 16   S 32  Fe 56  Ba 137 </p><p>5．正交晶型的黑磷具有半导体性质，应用前景广阔。与石墨相似，黑磷具有层状结构，层间依靠范德华力结合，层内原子形成连续的立体六元环-褶皱蜂巢型结构，单层黑磷又称磷烯（结构片段如图所示）。下列说法正确的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:c11d8a1ba584be2b0e6abafcebf2bea9ed45046e03165d7f0c0c83ca08b41450:0;\" style=\"width:199.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A．黑磷与石墨的导电原理相同，黑磷的导电性不如石墨强</p><p>B．黑磷与石墨的晶体类型相同，黑磷的熔沸点比石墨更高</p><p>C．相同物质的量的磷烯与石墨烯，所含<img src=\"chem-asset:c5efd036929450edf47f527a10025d8e11250d203aeb475d75319e08ea27b760:1;\" style=\"width:11.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">键个数基本相同</p><p>D．黑磷中的磷原子采取<img src=\"chem-asset:5b92e560e7d320aa21c95877d122277aa369e3842afbe739387d2cbfbe7628be:2;\" style=\"width:21.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">杂化，不可能再与其他原子形成化学键</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【详解】A．石墨为导体，导电依赖层内离域π电子；黑磷为半导体，导电依赖电子/空穴跃迁，导电原理不同，A错误；</p><p>B．二者均为层状结构（混合晶体），但石墨层内C-C键能远大于黑磷层内P-P键能，故黑磷熔沸点低于石墨，B错误；</p><p>C．石墨烯中每个C原子形成3个σ键（<img src=\"chem-asset:691a0fa022c52adfa5a1639510536ec73656fcefc89d93c52315d9bec0a42822:3;\" style=\"width:21.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">杂化），每个σ键被2个C共用，1 mol C含1.5 mol σ键；磷烯中每个P原子形成3个σ键（类比褶皱结构中P的成键），每个σ键被2个P共用，1 mol P也含1.5 mol σ键，故相同物质的量时σ键数基本相同，C正确；</p><p>D．P为<img src=\"chem-asset:5b92e560e7d320aa21c95877d122277aa369e3842afbe739387d2cbfbe7628be:4;\" style=\"width:21.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">杂化，存在孤对电子（如3个σ键+1对孤对电子），孤对电子可与其他原子形成配位键，D错误；</p><p>故答案选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.3.9\\化学一模提分卷（湖南专用）学易金卷：2026年高考第一次模拟考试\\化学一模提分卷（湖南专用）（全解全析） .docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.3.9/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%A8%A1%E6%8F%90%E5%88%86%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%E5%AD%A6%E6%98%93%E9%87%91%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%9A2026%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%A8%A1%E6%8F%90%E5%88%86%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%88%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E5%85%A8%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%89%20.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["5b92e560e7d320aa21c95877d122277aa369e3842afbe739387d2cbfbe7628be","691a0fa022c52adfa5a1639510536ec73656fcefc89d93c52315d9bec0a42822","c11d8a1ba584be2b0e6abafcebf2bea9ed45046e03165d7f0c0c83ca08b41450","c5efd036929450edf47f527a10025d8e11250d203aeb475d75319e08ea27b760"],"refs":{"chem-asset:c11d8a1ba584be2b0e6abafcebf2bea9ed45046e03165d7f0c0c83ca08b41450:0;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/c11d8a1ba584be2b0e6abafc.png","chem-asset:c5efd036929450edf47f527a10025d8e11250d203aeb475d75319e08ea27b760:1;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/fe9259084a0fc1303572c0d2.png","chem-asset:5b92e560e7d320aa21c95877d122277aa369e3842afbe739387d2cbfbe7628be:2;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/bb1e53ed87ed08f71a266bd7.png","chem-asset:691a0fa022c52adfa5a1639510536ec73656fcefc89d93c52315d9bec0a42822:3;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/55d481174ea98325d8abdda6.png","chem-asset:5b92e560e7d320aa21c95877d122277aa369e3842afbe739387d2cbfbe7628be:4;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/45fc909a104fc995c8cb4d07.png"},"sourceSha256":"86fd9f7bee046e201c01033e35d5fcef26710c852db4c8c87ebc12981a3c5da6","bom":false,"legacyPath":"物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/常见几种晶体类型/2026.3.9/P03-Q05_黑磷与石墨的层状结构.html"},"2026.3.9:P05-Q09":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>钯铜催化合成苯乙炔</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.3.9 · 二模模拟卷（湖南专用） · 原题9 · P05-Q09</div><h1>钯铜催化合成苯乙炔</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学反应原理/化学反应速率/活化能/基元反应与反应历程</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：识别催化剂、还原步骤与原子利用率。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应基本概念</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/认识有机物/有机反应类型</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/影响化学平衡的因素</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/有机物的合成与推断</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H 1  C 12  O 16   N 14   Zr 91</p><p>9．利用Sonogashira反应机理合成苯乙炔的基本过程如图，其中<img src=\"chem-asset:b21412f5f203120a597a32713e40b30995687daacdf362104edb0f35bca230e3:0;\" style=\"width:18.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">表示配体<img src=\"chem-asset:6fba3aa2853709b49136dc27b1ef8ac1e32f69c4064db92046630d9faf8d1ec0:1;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，下列叙述正确的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:fa60340f7357edc89d115b3d90ce15a59163281e4607fff7173e047de5bc6841:2;\" style=\"width:318.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">  </p><p>A．步骤④过程中，<img src=\"chem-asset:0e6e79b245c5ddfc614a18cb82e911d703c7d7b10fffc4d3c1b5564f1b8052cb:3;\" style=\"width:19.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">元素被还原</p><p>B．<img src=\"chem-asset:467179ad5befa43aa6c97236537f0dc765a0eca4437db6c6ab96ecf7e8065e4a:4;\" style=\"width:34.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:9bc2efa33b3308c31a026e59d54ce086b06099afd2bcfe5c95e09472ef2045e1:5;\" style=\"width:25.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">是该反应过程的催化剂，可以提高<img src=\"chem-asset:8611e3c460ddc42fcaf057d75546b9409c62daaedf9433739299fbfa103e23a7:6;\" style=\"width:69.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的平衡转化率</p><p>C．总反应的原子利用率达到100%</p><p>D．若用苯乙炔代替上述过程中的同类物质与<img src=\"chem-asset:ad6dfeba3420d7817fff7dcfb78c470072c098a444c9a7334eed5bc83343f47b:7;\" style=\"width:68.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">反应，可以合成<img src=\"chem-asset:be7fac5ee51b2ebe2d1f27391a950c2bc819f9eded14cfac495898ffa4ee9aed:8;\" style=\"width:109.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">  </p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】A</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【详解】A．步骤④过程中，Pd的化合价由+2变为0，化合价降低，元素被还原，故A正确；</p><p>B．催化剂不能使平衡移动，碘苯的平衡转化率不变，故B错误；</p><p>C．由图可知，反应为乙炔和<img src=\"chem-asset:f56002825cf9e4ae9e2195da6b535f44fd05b2ddb82ff799ee58b8900183781b:9;\" style=\"width:74.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">生成苯乙炔和HI的反应，反应为取代反应，有HI生成，故总反应的原子利用率小于100%，故C错误；</p><p>D．若用苯乙炔代替上述过程中的同类物质与<img src=\"chem-asset:ad6dfeba3420d7817fff7dcfb78c470072c098a444c9a7334eed5bc83343f47b:7;\" style=\"width:68.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">发生取代反应，可以合成<img src=\"chem-asset:7696adef38efa66b83f7fdd1f34ac87d45f8e8b9db1f755a9b5f9b25464bdc73:10;\" style=\"width:121.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故D错误；</p><p>故选A。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.3.9\\化学二模模拟卷（湖南专用）学易金卷：2026年高考第二次模拟考试\\化学二模模拟卷（湖南专用）（全解全析）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.3.9/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%BA%8C%E6%A8%A1%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%E5%AD%A6%E6%98%93%E9%87%91%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%9A2026%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%BA%8C%E6%A8%A1%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%88%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E5%85%A8%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["0e6e79b245c5ddfc614a18cb82e911d703c7d7b10fffc4d3c1b5564f1b8052cb","467179ad5befa43aa6c97236537f0dc765a0eca4437db6c6ab96ecf7e8065e4a","6fba3aa2853709b49136dc27b1ef8ac1e32f69c4064db92046630d9faf8d1ec0","7696adef38efa66b83f7fdd1f34ac87d45f8e8b9db1f755a9b5f9b25464bdc73","8611e3c460ddc42fcaf057d75546b9409c62daaedf9433739299fbfa103e23a7","9bc2efa33b3308c31a026e59d54ce086b06099afd2bcfe5c95e09472ef2045e1","ad6dfeba3420d7817fff7dcfb78c470072c098a444c9a7334eed5bc83343f47b","b21412f5f203120a597a32713e40b30995687daacdf362104edb0f35bca230e3","be7fac5ee51b2ebe2d1f27391a950c2bc819f9eded14cfac495898ffa4ee9aed","f56002825cf9e4ae9e2195da6b535f44fd05b2ddb82ff799ee58b8900183781b","fa60340f7357edc89d115b3d90ce15a59163281e4607fff7173e047de5bc6841"],"refs":{"chem-asset:b21412f5f203120a597a32713e40b30995687daacdf362104edb0f35bca230e3:0;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/7e0ca4b891d78fe5c816a4a6.png","chem-asset:6fba3aa2853709b49136dc27b1ef8ac1e32f69c4064db92046630d9faf8d1ec0:1;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/a3bf6aa8a40695f942b24643.png","chem-asset:fa60340f7357edc89d115b3d90ce15a59163281e4607fff7173e047de5bc6841:2;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/fa60340f7357edc89d115b3d.png","chem-asset:0e6e79b245c5ddfc614a18cb82e911d703c7d7b10fffc4d3c1b5564f1b8052cb:3;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/b59dad03981c6c11d2c19876.png","chem-asset:467179ad5befa43aa6c97236537f0dc765a0eca4437db6c6ab96ecf7e8065e4a:4;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/154624b49feb1053c4655432.png","chem-asset:9bc2efa33b3308c31a026e59d54ce086b06099afd2bcfe5c95e09472ef2045e1:5;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/751ec733b76b867c61be1d25.png","chem-asset:8611e3c460ddc42fcaf057d75546b9409c62daaedf9433739299fbfa103e23a7:6;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/8611e3c460ddc42fcaf057d7.png","chem-asset:ad6dfeba3420d7817fff7dcfb78c470072c098a444c9a7334eed5bc83343f47b:7;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/c74c54716de767b8f2cc6d73.png","chem-asset:be7fac5ee51b2ebe2d1f27391a950c2bc819f9eded14cfac495898ffa4ee9aed:8;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/be7fac5ee51b2ebe2d1f2739.png","chem-asset:f56002825cf9e4ae9e2195da6b535f44fd05b2ddb82ff799ee58b8900183781b:9;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/f56002825cf9e4ae9e2195da.png","chem-asset:7696adef38efa66b83f7fdd1f34ac87d45f8e8b9db1f755a9b5f9b25464bdc73:10;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/7696adef38efa66b83f7fdd1.png"},"sourceSha256":"92a9d319f9492e52cb824576ba2db391367e9cf2330a3b5ea4c249f931ba319f","bom":false,"legacyPath":"化学反应原理/化学反应速率/活化能/基元反应与反应历程/2026.3.9/P05-Q09_钯铜催化合成苯乙炔.html"},"2026.3.9:P05-Q13":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>硫化锡沉淀与氢硫酸电离</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.3.9 · 二模模拟卷（湖南专用） · 原题13 · P05-Q13</div><h1>硫化锡沉淀与氢硫酸电离</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学反应原理/沉淀溶解平衡/溶度积</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：联立沉淀与逐级电离解析对数图。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/弱电解质的电离/电离平衡常数和电离度</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/溶液的酸碱性与pH</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/化学平衡图像</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H 1  C 12  O 16   N 14   Zr 91</p><p>13．室温下，向含有<img src=\"chem-asset:23c0ed113b111f13dbeaabbbe49ddd7e917c4f5eb0a1fc00ae0b29d7fb278969:0;\" style=\"width:41.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的酸性溶液中通入<img src=\"chem-asset:445172bbf2a17b8148fd6b288e505ce48e5c3b56539ad605be72022c6e2cf8fa:1;\" style=\"width:26.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">生成<img src=\"chem-asset:de05f59301b1244732c8f0820b47b981c19197809ac13fc7afde64fa5273e019:2;\" style=\"width:25.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">沉淀，若始终保持<img src=\"chem-asset:445172bbf2a17b8148fd6b288e505ce48e5c3b56539ad605be72022c6e2cf8fa:1;\" style=\"width:26.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的浓度为<img src=\"chem-asset:c9f59904c3e7d66e79f98dc32fb5a92a433772be266d0daca28e3928ac9a0845:3;\" style=\"width:68.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，体系中<img src=\"chem-asset:a2c01da14fc076e43e799ee510268c6b8bb990327c55bf1bba0731c966691b8a:4;\" style=\"width:22.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">[<img src=\"chem-asset:c78b0a68f8fb9906780c4fa0b2a4da36fc97fef9f193b983f4a92afb90cffb84:5;\" style=\"width:34.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，X为<img src=\"chem-asset:9ba85eae54d60790cfd22085653c60c7becac2fc68d4598be903779bf15a1730:6;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:0c5c8e12531aed010fdfc716b96aa91886831a9a6a07eba4f054e56ba76c178c:7;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:a01717cb755544799785b0ad366acd714493dbcdf42f0e1607f886ce8721a2b8:8;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">]与pH的关系如图所示，已知<img src=\"chem-asset:0d780ec4a2e0318300d8496058e3e37b55d85a7349838207b684425f17746f3d:9;\" style=\"width:97.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。下列说法正确的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:4eca17e226664078f7183f32c56af8cce663458f37953416d863206165c00476:10;\" style=\"width:238.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A．线①表示<img src=\"chem-asset:bd7192950957a67b8317dbd37d7549394924c66eb5abc63eaf0c1f6a0c8b8abd:11;\" style=\"width:55.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">随pH的变化</p><p>B．A点坐标为<img src=\"chem-asset:4f0e5dbc8065e9ea778227fcc2987d6ce1ed0033dcaaedc5957bb914ac6f3605:12;\" style=\"width:48.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C．D点<img src=\"chem-asset:d1fc977508147be8a33fc9537faecf1f0f766ef4271e9cc78b70dfa2f183e811:13;\" style=\"width:136.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D．C点与E点溶液中的<img src=\"chem-asset:4d7b914df9e154f551d5ff5258a3229566a063a794873b45d66e4eede0ccd7b7:14;\" style=\"width:36.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">之比为<img src=\"chem-asset:73c3e204b94a1463f94f747ab18002a2432314564ecf01a7fc24388dcb5016a3:15;\" style=\"width:39.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】A</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【分析】氢硫酸是二元弱酸，一级电离常数远大于二级电离常数，则溶液pH相同时，溶液中<img src=\"chem-asset:9ba85eae54d60790cfd22085653c60c7becac2fc68d4598be903779bf15a1730:6;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">大于<img src=\"chem-asset:0c5c8e12531aed010fdfc716b96aa91886831a9a6a07eba4f054e56ba76c178c:7;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">；向硫酸锡溶液中通入硫化氢时，溶液中锡离子浓度减小，则曲线①、②、③分别表示p<img src=\"chem-asset:0c5c8e12531aed010fdfc716b96aa91886831a9a6a07eba4f054e56ba76c178c:7;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">　、p<img src=\"chem-asset:9ba85eae54d60790cfd22085653c60c7becac2fc68d4598be903779bf15a1730:6;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、p<img src=\"chem-asset:a01717cb755544799785b0ad366acd714493dbcdf42f0e1607f886ce8721a2b8:8;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">随pH的变化；由图可知，C点溶液中pH为5时，溶液中p<img src=\"chem-asset:9ba85eae54d60790cfd22085653c60c7becac2fc68d4598be903779bf15a1730:6;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为2.2，则氢硫酸的一级电离常数为：<img src=\"chem-asset:55bbffe5b36c220ca9cf76ee1a9e7f02596e337fdf860b5763d696a32f5c40cd:16;\" style=\"width:155.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=10<sup>-5</sup>×10<sup>-2.2</sup>=10<sup>-7.2</sup>；B点溶液中pH为5时，溶液中p<img src=\"chem-asset:0c5c8e12531aed010fdfc716b96aa91886831a9a6a07eba4f054e56ba76c178c:7;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为7.2，则氢硫酸的二级电离常数为：<img src=\"chem-asset:428de2d6fa3ed62ca63f54661144a4c269c3075f0bb187c3a70d75adfe29e830:17;\" style=\"width:151.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=10<sup>-5</sup>×10<sup>-7.2</sup>=10<sup>-12.2</sup>。</p><p>【详解】A．由分析可知，曲线①、②、③分别表示p<img src=\"chem-asset:0c5c8e12531aed010fdfc716b96aa91886831a9a6a07eba4f054e56ba76c178c:7;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">　、p<img src=\"chem-asset:9ba85eae54d60790cfd22085653c60c7becac2fc68d4598be903779bf15a1730:6;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、p<img src=\"chem-asset:a01717cb755544799785b0ad366acd714493dbcdf42f0e1607f886ce8721a2b8:8;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">随pH的变化，A正确；</p><p>B．由图可知，A点溶液pH为5，溶液中氢硫酸的浓度为0.1 mol/L，由电离常数可得：<img src=\"chem-asset:50b055b0c4947e2b8a37f1af3d3ade382daaf13f4c188d4685eba3d2e98a0af2:18;\" style=\"width:213.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=10<sup>-7.2</sup>×10<sup>-12.2</sup>=10<sup>-19.4</sup>，则溶液中硫离子浓度为：<img src=\"chem-asset:362b37e808ad55912f26d6af950f5996f044d938f6bf949601832a80fbc0713e:19;\" style=\"width:102.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=10<sup>-10.4</sup> mol/L；由溶度积可知，溶液中锡离子的浓度为：<img src=\"chem-asset:8661e961d1252e4076ad33331db644f4aae9b6caf2c930754acd7cb4e1d8a2f2:20;\" style=\"width:71.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=10<sup>-14.6</sup> mol/L，则A点坐标为<img src=\"chem-asset:633308bebad49027d5f1b9c1868409ca7df8b8aa6d573157830d708675aad44b:21;\" style=\"width:49.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B错误；</p><p>C．由图可知，D点溶液pH为2、氢硫酸的浓度为0.1 mol/L，由氢硫酸的一级电离常数可知，溶液中硫氢根离子的浓度为：<img src=\"chem-asset:9bcb11d96dd295c3d4b8c1929e85bd7243e366380113f3ca5eb19eec375ee437:22;\" style=\"width:97.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=10<sup>-6.2 </sup>mol/L，C错误；</p><p>D．由图可知，C点溶液中pH为5、氢硫酸的浓度为0.1 mol/L，由电离常数可得：<img src=\"chem-asset:50b055b0c4947e2b8a37f1af3d3ade382daaf13f4c188d4685eba3d2e98a0af2:18;\" style=\"width:213.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=10<sup>-7.2</sup>×10<sup>-12.2</sup>=10<sup>-19.4</sup>，则溶液中硫离子浓度为：<img src=\"chem-asset:362b37e808ad55912f26d6af950f5996f044d938f6bf949601832a80fbc0713e:19;\" style=\"width:102.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=10<sup>-10.4</sup> mol/L；E点溶液pH为2、氢硫酸的浓度为0.1 mol/L，由电离常数可得：<img src=\"chem-asset:50b055b0c4947e2b8a37f1af3d3ade382daaf13f4c188d4685eba3d2e98a0af2:18;\" style=\"width:213.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=10<sup>-7.2</sup>×10<sup>-12.2</sup>=10<sup>-19.4</sup>，则溶液中硫离子浓度为：<img src=\"chem-asset:494b1cb1f18e9cb8efe481a646328967ed87f12da9f429d4ae350975357a593a:23;\" style=\"width:102.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=10<sup>-16.4</sup> mol/L，则C点与E点溶液中硫离子浓度之比为：<img src=\"chem-asset:adf8b1bb507f90c135cdbd6d154e112b6eed152fdf5c8fe2b9f2c6dc842d1b30:24;\" style=\"width:193.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，D错误；</p><p>故选A。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.3.9\\化学二模模拟卷（湖南专用）学易金卷：2026年高考第二次模拟考试\\化学二模模拟卷（湖南专用）（全解全析）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.3.9/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%BA%8C%E6%A8%A1%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%E5%AD%A6%E6%98%93%E9%87%91%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%9A2026%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%BA%8C%E6%A8%A1%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%88%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E5%85%A8%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["0c5c8e12531aed010fdfc716b96aa91886831a9a6a07eba4f054e56ba76c178c","0d780ec4a2e0318300d8496058e3e37b55d85a7349838207b684425f17746f3d","23c0ed113b111f13dbeaabbbe49ddd7e917c4f5eb0a1fc00ae0b29d7fb278969","362b37e808ad55912f26d6af950f5996f044d938f6bf949601832a80fbc0713e","428de2d6fa3ed62ca63f54661144a4c269c3075f0bb187c3a70d75adfe29e830","445172bbf2a17b8148fd6b288e505ce48e5c3b56539ad605be72022c6e2cf8fa","494b1cb1f18e9cb8efe481a646328